TO ORDER. SECRETARY, PLEASE CALL

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:42.609
THE ROLL. ALLEN ALVARADO. GILL.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:45.512
ARCHULETA. ASHBY ATKINS. BECKER.

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:50.617
BLAKE SPEER. BRADFORD. CABALLERO

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:53.386
CORTEZ. DALLY. DODD DURAZO.

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:59.025
EGGMAN GLASER. GONZALEZ. GROVE

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:02.128
HURTADO. JONES. LAIRD LIMÓN.

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:04.831
MCGUIRE. MENGIBAR MINH. NEWMAN.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:10.136
NGUYEN NILO. OKOBO. PADILLA

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:14.641
PORTANTINO. ROTH RUBIO. SATO

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:15.208
SKINNER. SMALLWOOD. CUEVAS.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:20.180
STERN UMBERG. WAHAB. WIENER

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:26.886
WILK. HERE TODAY. YES. CORTEZ.

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:30.723
MEMBERS MEMBERS. THE QUORUM IS

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:33.026
PRESENT. I'D LIKE TO ASK MEMBERS

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:34.828
AND GUESTS. BEYOND THE RAIL AND

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:36.296
IN THE GALLERY TO PLEASE RISE.

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.231
WE WILL BE LED IN PRAYER THIS

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:39.732
MORNING BY OUR CHAPLAIN, SISTER

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:41.468
MICHELLE. AFTER WHICH PLEASE

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:45.138
REMAIN STANDING FOR THE PLEDGE

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:51.244
OF ALLEGIANCE. SISTER MICHELLE.

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:54.113
SO LET US GATHER IN GOD'S

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:57.317
PRESENCE. WE HOLD THESE TRUTHS

00:01:57.383 --> 00:02:00.086
TO BE SELF-EVIDENT, THAT ALL

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:03.156
PERSONS ARE CREATED EQUAL, THAT

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:04.224
THEY ARE ENDOWED BY THEIR

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.758
CREATOR WITH CERTAIN

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:08.228
UNALIENABLE, UNALIENABLE RIGHTS,

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:11.264
THAT AMONG THESE ARE LIFE,

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:13.666
LIBERTY, AND THE PURSUIT OF

00:02:13.733 --> 00:02:17.003
HAPPINESS. GRACIOUS GOD OF THE

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.506
PAST, PRESENT AND FUTURE. AS WE

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:21.808
CELEBRATE THE BIRTHDAY OF OUR

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:22.342
NATIONAL INDEPENDENCE, WE

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:25.278
CONFESS OUR ONGOING DEPENDANCE

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:30.650
ON YOU. WE PRAY THAT WE WILL

00:02:30.717 --> 00:02:31.718
CONTINUE TO MAKE REAL THE

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:34.821
COURAGE OF OUR FORBEARERS ON

00:02:34.888 --> 00:02:39.559
THESE TEMPESTUOUS DAYS. MAY OUR

00:02:39.626 --> 00:02:40.727
FREEDOM OF SPEECH SERVE TO BUILD

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:43.062
COMMUNITY AND COLLABORATION. MAY

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:46.032
OUR FREEDOM OF WORSHIP LEAD US

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:48.701
TO GRATITUDE FOR ALL WE HAVE

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:51.704
RECEIVED. AND MAY OUR FREEDOM

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:54.240
FROM WANT AND FEAR ENRICH US

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:56.910
WITH CREATIVE IDEAS FOR ENSURING

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:59.879
THE LIFE, LIBERTY, AND HAPPINESS

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.215
OF ALL OF OUR BROTHERS AND

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:05.251
SISTERS. MAY ALL THAT IS HIGH

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:08.454
AND FINE IN US RISE TO GREET

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:11.291
EACH NEW DAY CONFIDENT THAT WE

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:14.127
WILL ACHIEVE THE IDEALS THAT WE

00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:19.432
KNOW TO BE SELF-EVIDENT. AMEN

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:20.533
MEMBERS AND GUESTS, PLEASE JOIN

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.602
ME IN THE PLEDGE OF ALLEGIANCE.

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:28.274
I PLEDGE ALLEGIANCE TO THE FLAG.

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:29.509
AND TO SERVE THE PUBLIC WHICH IT

00:03:29.576 --> 00:03:32.145
STANDS. ONE NATION UNDER GOD,

00:03:32.211 --> 00:03:33.179
INDIVISIBLE, WITH LIBERTY AND

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:45.325
JUSTICE FOR.

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:51.264
OKAY SENATOR GROVE, FOR WHAT

00:03:51.331 --> 00:03:52.465
PURPOSE DO YOU RISE? THANK YOU,

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:53.733
MADAM PRESIDENT. I HAVE A

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.034
PARLIAMENTARY INQUIRY. WHAT IS

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:57.837
THAT. IS IT IS IT THE PRACTICE

00:03:57.904 --> 00:04:00.773
AND CUSTOM OF THE SENATE THAT

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.809
THE SENATE RULE 55 BE SUSPENDED

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:03.409
WHEN MEMBERS OF THE

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:05.311
ADMINISTRATION WISH TO BE

00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:06.079
PRESENT IN THE CHAMBER? SENATOR,

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:09.983
THAT IS THE RULES OF THE SENATE.

00:04:10.049 --> 00:04:12.719
SO, SINCE THAT'S THE CASE, I'M

00:04:12.785 --> 00:04:13.920
WONDERING IF WE NEED TO SUSPEND

00:04:13.987 --> 00:04:15.655
SENATE RULE 55 TO ALLOW GOVERNOR

00:04:15.722 --> 00:04:16.489
MCGUIRE TO BE IN THE CHAMBER

00:04:16.556 --> 00:04:18.691
WITH US TODAY. SENATOR, THANK

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:22.428
YOU FOR YOUR INQUIRY. GIVEN THAT

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:25.298
THE PERSON IN QUESTION IS A

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:27.000
MEMBER OF THE SENATE AND ONLY IN

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:30.136
AN ACTING CAPACITY, I THINK IT

00:04:30.203 --> 00:04:32.038
WE'LL FIND THAT THAT RULE DOES

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:34.040
NOT NEED TO BE SUSPENDED TODAY,

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:35.541
BUT WE APPRECIATE YOU BRINGING

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:36.643
THAT TO OUR ATTENTION. THANK YOU

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:37.810
FOR YOUR CLARIFICATION, SIR.

00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:41.114
THANK YOU, SENATOR GROVE. PAGING

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.048
ACTING GOVERNOR MCGUIRE. THE

00:04:42.115 --> 00:04:46.853
FRONT DESK. OKAY. ALL RIGHT,

00:04:46.919 --> 00:04:49.622
MEMBERS, WITHOUT OBJECTION,

00:04:49.689 --> 00:04:50.623
WITHOUT OBJECTION, WE'RE GOING

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.325
TO MOVE TO SENATE. THIRD READING

00:04:52.392 --> 00:04:56.329
TO TAKE UP FILE ITEM 39. SENATE

00:04:56.396 --> 00:04:57.430
RESOLUTION 99 BY SENATOR BLAKE

00:04:57.497 --> 00:05:02.335
SPEER. SHE IS PREPARED SECRETARY,

00:05:02.402 --> 00:05:04.504
PLEASE READ SENATE RESOLUTION 99

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.673
BY SENATOR BLAKE SPEER. RELATIVE

00:05:06.739 --> 00:05:07.907
TO THE 4TH OF JULY. SENATOR

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:09.942
BLAKE SPEER, A MEMBERS. LET'S

00:05:10.009 --> 00:05:10.943
GIVE SENATOR BLAKE SPEER OUR

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:13.046
ATTENTION, PLEASE. SENATOR BLAKE

00:05:13.112 --> 00:05:14.213
SPEER, THE FLOOR IS YOURS. THANK

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.682
YOU, MR. PRESIDENT. AND

00:05:15.748 --> 00:05:17.417
COLLEAGUES, I RISE TODAY TO

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:18.651
PRESENT SENATE RESOLUTION 99,

00:05:18.718 --> 00:05:21.421
RECOGNIZING THE SIGNIFICANCE OF

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:22.522
INDEPENDENCE DAY ON JULY 4TH.

00:05:22.588 --> 00:05:24.457
THIS IS OUR MOST SIGNIFICANT

00:05:24.524 --> 00:05:25.425
NATIONAL HOLIDAY. NOW MORE THAN

00:05:25.491 --> 00:05:28.094
EVER, WE NEED TO BE REMINDED OF

00:05:28.161 --> 00:05:29.128
THE PROFOUND IMPORTANCE OF OUR

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:30.763
SHARED VALUES AS AMERICANS AND

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.032
AS CALIFORNIANS THAT THIS DAY

00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:35.068
HOLDS FOR OUR NATION AND FOR

00:05:35.134 --> 00:05:36.202
THIS GREAT STATE. ALL OF YOU

00:05:36.269 --> 00:05:38.371
KNOW, THE HISTORY OF OUR

00:05:38.438 --> 00:05:39.505
COUNTRY, BUT I JUST WANT TO

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:41.774
FOCUS ON THE VERY BEGINNING,

00:05:41.841 --> 00:05:44.010
WHICH WAS ON JULY 4TH, 1776. OUR

00:05:44.077 --> 00:05:45.878
FOREFATHERS TOOK THE BOLD STEP

00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:47.046
OF DECLARING INDEPENDENCE FROM

00:05:47.113 --> 00:05:49.515
BRITAIN, SETTING IN MOTION THE

00:05:49.582 --> 00:05:51.684
BIRTH OF AMERICAN DEMOCRACY AND

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:52.685
ARTICULATING THE PRINCIPLES THAT

00:05:52.752 --> 00:05:54.887
CONTINUE TO GUIDE US AND THE

00:05:54.954 --> 00:05:56.856
WORLD'S OTHER DEMOCRACIES TODAY.

00:05:56.923 --> 00:05:57.924
THE SECOND SENTENCE OF THE

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:58.858
DECLARATION OF INDEPENDENCE,

00:05:58.925 --> 00:06:00.693
WHICH WHICH MICHELLE GORMAN

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.162
BEGAN HER PRAYER WITH TODAY, IS

00:06:03.229 --> 00:06:04.397
ARGUABLY ONE OF THE BEST KNOWN

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:06.332
AND MOST CONSEQUENTIAL SENTENCES

00:06:06.399 --> 00:06:08.668
IN THE ENGLISH LANGUAGE BECAUSE

00:06:08.735 --> 00:06:11.137
IT CLEARLY STATES A MORAL

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:11.537
STANDARD OF HUMAN

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:14.307
SELF-DETERMINATION THAT WE HAVE

00:06:14.373 --> 00:06:15.374
SPENT NEARLY 250 YEARS IN

00:06:15.441 --> 00:06:17.310
CONSTANT STRUGGLE TO ACTUALIZE

00:06:17.376 --> 00:06:19.879
THE SENTENCE THAT BEGINS, WE

00:06:19.946 --> 00:06:21.013
HOLD THESE TRUTHS TO BE SELF

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.750
SELF-EVIDENT AND ENDS WITH LIFE,

00:06:23.816 --> 00:06:24.817
LIBERTY, AND THE PURSUIT OF

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:27.587
HAPPINESS. ALEXANDER HAMILTON,

00:06:27.653 --> 00:06:28.755
ONE OF OUR NATION'S FOUNDING

00:06:28.821 --> 00:06:30.323
FATHERS, PUT THIS SAME CONCEPT A

00:06:30.389 --> 00:06:31.390
DIFFERENT WAY. HE SAID. THE

00:06:31.457 --> 00:06:33.526
SACRED RIGHTS OF MANKIND ARE NOT

00:06:33.593 --> 00:06:36.496
TO BE RUMMAGED FOR AMONG OLD

00:06:36.562 --> 00:06:37.497
PARCHMENTS OR MUSTY RECORDS.

00:06:37.563 --> 00:06:39.832
THEY ARE WRITTEN, AS WITH A

00:06:39.899 --> 00:06:41.067
SUNBEAM IN THE WHOLE VOLUME OF

00:06:41.134 --> 00:06:43.770
HUMAN NATURE BY THE HAND OF

00:06:43.836 --> 00:06:44.871
DIVINITY ITSELF, AND CAN NEVER

00:06:44.937 --> 00:06:46.739
BE ERASED OR OBSCURED BY MORTAL

00:06:46.806 --> 00:06:48.841
POWER. OUR FOUNDING FATHERS WERE

00:06:48.908 --> 00:06:49.942
STATESMEN AND PATRIOTS, BUT WE

00:06:50.009 --> 00:06:52.678
KNOW THAT TODAY. SPEAKING ABOUT

00:06:52.745 --> 00:06:54.313
THE TIMELESS AND UNALIENABLE

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:55.348
NATURE OF THESE RIGHTS IS NOT

00:06:55.414 --> 00:06:58.017
ENOUGH. HERE IN CALIFORNIA, AND

00:06:58.084 --> 00:06:58.985
SPECIFICALLY HERE IN THE

00:06:59.051 --> 00:07:00.353
CALIFORNIA STATE LEGISLATURE, WE

00:07:00.419 --> 00:07:02.789
STRUGGLE EVERY DAY WITH THE

00:07:02.855 --> 00:07:03.990
CHARGE TO MAKE REAL WHAT THESE

00:07:04.056 --> 00:07:06.058
RIGHTS TO SELF-DETERMINATION,

00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:07.026
FREEDOM, LIBERTY, EQUALITY, AND

00:07:07.093 --> 00:07:08.861
THE PURSUIT OF HAPPINESS MEANS.

00:07:08.928 --> 00:07:12.064
CENTERING OUR CURRENT POLICY

00:07:12.131 --> 00:07:13.266
DEBATES IN THE FRAMEWORK OF OUR

00:07:13.332 --> 00:07:15.067
AMERICAN HISTORY. I OFTEN THINK

00:07:15.134 --> 00:07:17.970
ON THE 4TH OF JULY ABOUT

00:07:18.037 --> 00:07:18.905
FREDERICK DOUGLASS AND HIS

00:07:18.971 --> 00:07:20.039
KEYNOTE ADDRESS IN 1852, WHICH

00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:24.677
WAS ENTITLED WHAT TO THE SLAVE

00:07:24.744 --> 00:07:25.812
IS THE 4TH OF JULY. HE

00:07:25.878 --> 00:07:27.647
RECOGNIZED THE HYPOCRISY OF

00:07:27.713 --> 00:07:28.681
ENSLAVING FELLOW HUMANS WHILE

00:07:28.748 --> 00:07:30.783
CELEBRATING THE IDEALS OF JULY

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:34.053
4TH. HE SAID, THE 4TH OF JULY IS

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.822
YOURS, NOT MINE. YOU MAY

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:36.923
REJOICE, I MUST MOURN. IT'S

00:07:36.989 --> 00:07:39.192
WORTH RECOGNIZING THAT

00:07:39.258 --> 00:07:40.092
JUNETEENTH, OUR MOST RECENT

00:07:40.159 --> 00:07:42.361
FEDERAL HOLIDAY, IS CELEBRATED

00:07:42.428 --> 00:07:45.064
JUST TWO WEEKS AND ONE DAY

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:46.265
BEFORE THE 4TH OF JULY. THIS

00:07:46.332 --> 00:07:48.201
FEDERAL HOLIDAY IS THE FIRST NEW

00:07:48.267 --> 00:07:49.869
NATIONAL HOLIDAY IN NEARLY 30

00:07:49.936 --> 00:07:52.205
YEARS. PRESIDENT JOE BIDEN

00:07:52.271 --> 00:07:53.206
SIGNED THE JUNETEENTH NATIONAL

00:07:53.272 --> 00:07:55.274
INDEPENDENCE DAY ACT INTO LAW

00:07:55.341 --> 00:07:57.610
JUST THREE DAYS AGO. OR SORRY,

00:07:57.677 --> 00:07:58.744
JUST THREE YEARS AGO. BOTH OF

00:07:58.811 --> 00:08:01.047
THESE HOLIDAYS, JULY 4TH AND

00:08:01.113 --> 00:08:03.216
JUNETEENTH, RECOGNIZE FREEDOM,

00:08:03.282 --> 00:08:04.183
NATIONAL FREEDOM AND PERSONAL

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:07.053
FREEDOM. AND BOTH OF THESE

00:08:07.119 --> 00:08:07.486
HOLIDAYS, WHICH ARE

00:08:07.553 --> 00:08:09.622
COMPLEMENTARY AND SHOW OUR

00:08:09.689 --> 00:08:10.656
COUNTRY'S EVOLUTION, REQUIRE US

00:08:10.723 --> 00:08:12.925
TO REMEMBER THAT THE PROGRESS

00:08:12.992 --> 00:08:14.627
WE'VE MADE COMES FROM THE

00:08:14.694 --> 00:08:15.595
CONSTANT STRUGGLE FOR THE

00:08:15.661 --> 00:08:18.731
PROMISE OF THE WORDS WRITTEN 248

00:08:18.798 --> 00:08:19.999
YEARS AGO AT OUR NATION'S BIRTH.

00:08:20.066 --> 00:08:22.034
THOSE WITH LESS PRIVILEGE,

00:08:22.101 --> 00:08:24.904
MINORITIES, WOMEN, PEOPLE OF ALL

00:08:24.971 --> 00:08:27.306
ABILITIES, GENDERS, RACES, AND

00:08:27.373 --> 00:08:27.907
ETHNICITIES HAVE CONSISTENTLY,

00:08:27.974 --> 00:08:30.476
DOGGEDLY AND WITH FIERCE

00:08:30.543 --> 00:08:31.444
COMMITMENT INSISTED ON THE

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:33.546
RIGHTS THAT AMERICA HAS

00:08:33.613 --> 00:08:36.616
PROMISED. THE 4TH OF JULY

00:08:36.682 --> 00:08:37.683
REMINDS US THAT DESPITE OUR

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.619
DIVERSE BACKGROUNDS AND OUR

00:08:39.685 --> 00:08:40.253
PERSPECTIVES, WE ARE ONE PEOPLE

00:08:40.319 --> 00:08:41.420
UNITED IN OUR PURSUIT OF LIFE,

00:08:41.487 --> 00:08:42.555
LIBERTY AND HAPPINESS. ON THE

00:08:42.622 --> 00:08:44.824
FOURTH, LET US CELEBRATE THE

00:08:44.891 --> 00:08:45.791
REMARKABLE JOURNEY OF OUR

00:08:45.858 --> 00:08:48.194
NATION, RECOGNIZING HOW FAR

00:08:48.261 --> 00:08:49.395
WE'VE COME WHILE ACKNOWLEDGING

00:08:49.462 --> 00:08:51.497
THE WORK THAT STILL LIES AHEAD,

00:08:51.564 --> 00:08:52.698
I URGE MY COLLEAGUES TO JOIN ME

00:08:52.765 --> 00:08:53.966
IN SUPPORTING THIS RESOLUTION

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:54.967
HONORING THE SPIRIT OF

00:08:55.034 --> 00:08:56.736
INDEPENDENCE DAY AND ENCOURAGING

00:08:56.802 --> 00:08:58.404
ALL CALIFORNIANS TO CELEBRATE

00:08:58.471 --> 00:09:00.172
THIS 4TH OF JULY WITH PRIDE,

00:09:00.239 --> 00:09:01.474
REFLECTION, AND HOPE FOR OUR

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.242
SHARED FUTURE. THANK YOU, MR.

00:09:03.309 --> 00:09:04.877
PRESIDENT. THANK YOU, SENATOR

00:09:04.944 --> 00:09:06.545
BLAKE SPEER. THE RESOLUTION HAS

00:09:06.612 --> 00:09:09.081
BEEN PLACED BEFORE THE BODY. I

00:09:09.148 --> 00:09:10.316
SEE A MICROPHONE UP FROM SENATOR

00:09:10.383 --> 00:09:11.317
JONES. SENATOR JONES, YOU'RE

00:09:11.384 --> 00:09:12.218
RECOGNIZED. THANK YOU, MR.

00:09:12.285 --> 00:09:14.287
PRESIDENT. AND SENATORS, I RISE

00:09:14.353 --> 00:09:16.689
IN SUPPORT OF SR 99 AND THANK

00:09:16.756 --> 00:09:18.424
OUR ESTEEMED COLLEAGUE FROM SAN

00:09:18.491 --> 00:09:19.759
DIEGO FOR BRINGING THIS TO THE

00:09:19.825 --> 00:09:21.093
FLOOR TODAY WITH PERMISSION TO

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.629
READ, MR. PRESIDENT, I'D LIKE TO

00:09:23.696 --> 00:09:25.665
SHARE SOME FOUNDING THOUGHTS ON

00:09:25.731 --> 00:09:26.599
INDEPENDENCE DAY. WITHOUT

00:09:26.666 --> 00:09:28.434
OBJECTION. THANK YOU, MR.

00:09:28.501 --> 00:09:29.435
PRESIDENT. JOHN ADAMS, WHEN

00:09:29.502 --> 00:09:31.370
WRITING ABOUT INDEPENDENCE DAY

00:09:31.437 --> 00:09:35.908
WAS VERY PROPHETIC IN HOW

00:09:35.975 --> 00:09:39.178
AMERICA WOULD COME TO CELEBRATE

00:09:39.245 --> 00:09:42.014
THE JULY 4TH CELEBRATION OR

00:09:42.081 --> 00:09:44.583
MEMORY HONOR OF WHAT HAD

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:46.419
HAPPENED IN THAT SIGNING OF THE

00:09:46.485 --> 00:09:47.320
DECLARATION OF INDEPENDENCE. AND

00:09:47.386 --> 00:09:50.056
IT'S VERY POIGNANT. I THINK, I

00:09:50.122 --> 00:09:52.091
HOPE FOR ALL OF US ON WHAT HE

00:09:52.158 --> 00:09:54.026
SAID AND HOW WE HAVE COME TO

00:09:54.093 --> 00:09:56.262
CELEBRATE THE HOLIDAY. AS HE

00:09:56.329 --> 00:09:59.165
DESCRIBES INDEPENDENCE DAY WILL

00:09:59.231 --> 00:10:00.399
BE THE MOST MEMORABLE EPOCHA IN

00:10:00.466 --> 00:10:03.636
THE HISTORY OF AMERICA. I AM APT

00:10:03.703 --> 00:10:06.205
TO BELIEVE THAT IT WILL BE

00:10:06.272 --> 00:10:07.673
CELEBRATED BY SUCCEEDING

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:10.109
GENERATIONS AS THE GREAT

00:10:10.176 --> 00:10:11.110
ANNIVERSARY FESTIVAL. IT OUGHT

00:10:11.177 --> 00:10:14.547
TO BE SOLEMNIZED WITH POMP AND

00:10:14.613 --> 00:10:19.618
PARADE, WITH SHEWS GAMES, SPORTS,

00:10:19.685 --> 00:10:21.687
GUNS, BELLS, BONFIRES AND

00:10:21.754 --> 00:10:25.658
ILLUMINATIONS. ILLUMINATIONS.

00:10:25.725 --> 00:10:26.892
FROM ONE END OF THIS CONTINENT

00:10:26.959 --> 00:10:29.161
TO THE OTHER END OF THIS

00:10:29.228 --> 00:10:31.430
CONTINENT. FROM THIS TIME

00:10:31.497 --> 00:10:33.799
FORWARD, FOREVERMORE. THANK YOU,

